Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.13,0:01:56.26,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,120)}私は煌めく
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.35,0:01:59.27,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}見上げてごらん
