Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:38.01,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,625)\blur5}少し笑って　どこまで進むの？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.38,0:21:59.30,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.55,0:22:01.01,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}愛されたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.01,0:22:07.39,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.85,0:22:11.10,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.10,0:22:13.90,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.86,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.86,0:22:19.15,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.28,0:22:22.36,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.36,0:22:24.91,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.91,0:22:27.79,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.79,0:22:30.29,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.29,0:22:33.42,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.42,0:22:37.46,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.63,0:22:43.72,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.26,0:22:50.06,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.06,0:22:52.39,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.39,0:22:55.52,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.52,0:23:01.49,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.61,0:23:05.62,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.66,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.58,0:23:19.34,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}きっと誰かの光だから
